{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Diabetic's Diary 是一款為糖尿病患者及關注個人健康的人士而設的離線優先紀錄工具，現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。它讓你在 iPhone 上整理健康資料，毋須建立帳戶，亦不會把紀錄傳送至開發者伺服器。</p>\n\n<h2>功能重點</h2>\n<p>可記錄血糖、尿酸、檢驗結果、飲食、水果、水分、藥物及運動，並查看本地圖表與 7 日、14 日或 30 日摘要。支援 iPhone 本地通知提醒用藥及補充水分，可讀取或儲存 Apple Health 數據，餐點照片會在 30 日內自動移除，可匯出最多 30 日 CSV 或 PDF；相容裝置上可使用 Apple 裝置端語言模型產生參考資訊。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-445-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-446-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-447-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-448-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-449-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-450-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Diabetic's Diary</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T18:59:16.577069+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}